<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<Mod>
    <Id>crxhvrd-overhaul</Id>
    <Name>Overhaul</Name>
    <Category>Gameplay</Category>
    <Thumbnail>Data/Images/overhaul/thumb.png</Thumbnail>
    <PreviewImage>Data/Images/overhaul/full.png</PreviewImage>
    <Description>Overhaul: improvements to the whole game. It works in the normal game; online co-op and PvP come with Overgrowth Online, a separate build. Press F9 in any level for the Overhaul window. AI: smarter, less predictable enemies built around the jump kick. They read and punish your kicks, fight in the air, use walls, ledges and high ground, throw weapons and respect yours, chase with hops, use footwork and feints, have personalities and learn your habits, and fight as teams that stick together, rescue allies and fall back to regroup. LARGE BATTLES (Play menu): 2 to 8 teams of up to 60 fighters on 128 clean maps (every campaign map without its story), each team with its own species, AI, skill, weapons, size and colours; place the teams yourself, spectate or fight. GUI: health panel, minimap, campaign objectives (the next checkpoint or the enemies to defeat), names and health above nearby characters, damage numbers, a combat log, attacker arrows. CAMERA: tune the third-person camera, a dynamic cinematic camera, first person (V), and cinematic finisher shots with slow motion when you finish an enemy or fall. WEATHER: any time of day, the sun moving or still and a moon at night, clouds, rain, storms, snow, blizzards. TRAINER: god mode, strength and speed, play as any character in your own colours, weapons, teleport, peaceful or knocked-out enemies, spawning, game speed and gravity. Replaces the game's character scripts (aschar.as, enemycontrol.as, situationawareness.as).</Description>
    <Version>0.38.9</Version>
    <Author>crxhvrd</Author>
    <Tag>AI</Tag>
    <Tag>Gameplay</Tag>
    <SupportedVersion>*</SupportedVersion>
    <NeedsRestart>false</NeedsRestart>
    <SupportsOnline>true</SupportsOnline>
    <LevelHookFile>Data/Scripts/overhaul_menu.as</LevelHookFile>

